    "title": "MICROSERVICE-PROD-Replace * Status Transition-spec",
    "description": "The Loan Status Transition Management API allows users to efficiently manage the status of loans by facilitating transitions between different statuses. This endpoint is primarily designed for financial institutions seeking to update loan statuses during various stages of the loan lifecycle. Typical consumers of this API include loan management systems and customer service applications that handle loan processing workflows. By enabling seamless status updates, this API enhances operational efficiency and improves customer experience.",
